{"parse": {"title": "独一调·【第一滴雨】", "pageid": 141639, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"item-infobox\"><div style=\"position:absolute; width:100%; height:100%; overflow:hidden;\"><div class=\"glow-top\"><div></div></div><div class=\"glow-bottom\"><div></div></div></div><div class=\"item-infobox-box\"><div class=\"item-infobox-image\"><img alt=\"独一调·【第一滴雨】\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/64/Item-143801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"独一调·【第一滴雨】\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></div><div class=\"item-infobox-content\"><div class=\"serif\" style=\"font-size:22px\"><b>独一调·【第一滴雨】</b><div class=\"hide-m test-hide grey-small\" style=\"float:right; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:16px\"><span class=\"no-select\">编号ID：</span>1#143801</div></div><hr /><div>毋需编织的、独一无二的线，可在【第一滴雨】征集中使纺车转动一周。<br />当前开启的【第一滴雨】征集关闭后，将自动转化为【独一律】。</div><div style=\"color:#696969\">你开始了解兔子们的好奇心。闪着光泽的生物在湖边蹦跳，窥探你行进的步子。瞧，你们都将行至湖边，兔子们窃窃私语，猜测谁将第一个跃入湖中。</div><span class=\"item-infobox-subtitle\"><small class=\"serif\" style=\"white-space:nowrap; font-weight:bold; color:#555\">内含</small><hr class=\"inline\" /></span><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"source-text\"><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"1/140001\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%80%E5%BE%8B\" title=\"独一律\"><img alt=\"Bgequip6.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/100px-Bgequip6.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/150px-Bgequip6.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/200px-Bgequip6.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%80%E5%BE%8B\" title=\"独一律\"><img alt=\"独一律\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/Item-140001.png/100px-Item-140001.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/Item-140001.png/150px-Item-140001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/Item-140001.png/200px-Item-140001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%8B%AC%E4%B8%80%E5%BE%8B\" title=\"独一律\">独一律</a><span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\">毋须编织的、独一无二的线，可使纺车转动一周。<br />用于角色的征集。</span></span><span>&#160;</span><span class=\"item-link-count\" style=\"float:right\">×1</span></span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "物品"}], "displaytitle": "独一调·【第一滴雨】"}}